@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `retirement-age-law`
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`

-- Wrapper over row IL-27's Retirement Age Law module, taking plain numbers so that the importers need not meet its sex type.
@ref s 1 "גיל הפרישה" (2); Retirement Age Law ss 3, 6, Part B
GIVEN month IS A NUMBER
      year IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Retirement Age Law's retirement age in months of a woman born in month` month `of` year MEANS
    `the retirement age, in months, of` (`A person, for the Retirement Age Law` OF `a woman`, year, month)
